# Cloudflare Pages response headers for files.sharpn.co.uk
# Any file of these types downloads instead of opening in the browser.
# The saved file name is the file's name in this repo, so name files the way
# you want them to arrive (lowercase, hyphens, no spaces).
# Max 100 rules. Don't add a second Content-Disposition rule for a file
# that already matches one of these: Cloudflare joins the two values and
# the download breaks.

/*.pdf
  Content-Disposition: attachment
/*.pptx
  Content-Disposition: attachment
/*.potx
  Content-Disposition: attachment
/*.ppsx
  Content-Disposition: attachment
/*.thmx
  Content-Disposition: attachment
/*.xlsx
  Content-Disposition: attachment
/*.docx
  Content-Disposition: attachment
/*.zip
  Content-Disposition: attachment
/*.exportedUI
  Content-Disposition: attachment
